            <note corresp="#d27-f2" n="2" xml:id="d27-f2-content">
                <p>Dated August 3. (Department of State, Central Files, POL AUSTL–US)</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d27-f3" n="3" xml:id="d27-f3-content">
                <p>Presidential advisers Clark Clifford and
                        Maxwell Taylor made a 2-week trip to
                    East Asia and the Pacific, in late July and early August, to consult with
                    government leaders in those nations assisting South Vietnam with military
                    forces.</p>
            </note>
